<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia growth forecast reasonable-Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia growth forecast reasonable-Costello.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday he believed the government's revised economic growth forecasts were reasonable.</p>
<p>&quot;I think most people would say to you that those growth forecasts are reasonable,&quot; Costello said on Australian Broadcasting Corp radio in answer to a question about whether the forecasts were too high.</p>
<p>&quot;I think most of the commentators this morning are saying yes, the economy is certainly picking up in the first half of this year and in fact, we're forecasting a strengthening next year,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
